---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About">
  <section class="page-hero ledger-field">
    <div class="wrap" style="position:relative; z-index:1;">
      <span class="eyebrow">About Accuro</span>
      <h1>Built to make financial complexity simple</h1>
      <p class="lede">Accuro Consultancy was founded on a simple belief: every business,
        regardless of size, deserves clear financial visibility and tools that fit
        the way they actually operate.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div>
          <h2>Our approach</h2>
          <p>We work closely with business owners and finance teams across the Maldives
            to bring structure to financial planning, reporting and day-to-day operations.
            Rather than handing over generic advice, we build practical systems — models,
            trackers and dashboards — that your team can own and run long after our
            engagement ends.</p>
          <p>Excel remains one of the most powerful tools available to a growing business,
            when it's built properly. That's the gap Accuro fills: professional-grade
            financial thinking, delivered through tools your team already knows how to use.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Why "Accuro"</h2>
          <p>The name reflects our focus on accuracy and care — in the numbers we build,
            the reports we prepare, and the advice we give. It's a word that speaks to
            precision without losing sight of the people behind the spreadsheet.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">What guides our work</span>
        <h2>Principles we hold to</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="index">01</span>
          <h3>Accuracy first</h3>
          <p>Every model and report is built to be checked, audited and trusted.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="index">02</span>
          <h3>Built for your team</h3>
          <p>Tools that your staff can maintain, not systems that require us forever.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="index">03</span>
          <h3>Clear communication</h3>
          <p>Financial concepts explained plainly, so decisions are easier to make.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2>Want to know more about how we work?</h2>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
